data: {"choices":[{"delta":{"tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"filePath\": \"/tmp/plan-note.md\", \"content\": \"# Plan (m1: greet, tested)\\n\\nMission: deliver `src/greet.py` with `greet(name)` returning `\\\"Hello, \u003cname\u003e!\\\"`,\\nand `tests/test_greet.py` covering a normal name and the empty string, with\\n`python3 -m unittest discover -s tests` exiting 0.\\n\\n## Plan\\n\\n1. Dispatch the full task to `dev` (owns the subject repo): implement\\n   `src/greet.py` and `tests/test_greet.py`, run the unittest discovery\\n   command, commit to its own branch, reply truthfully.\\n2. `wait` for dev's reply.\\n3. Judge: `read dev` for the reply and its measured branch evidence, then\\n   `fetch dev` and verify against the three criteria by inspecting files and\\n   running `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests` on the fetched tree.\\n4. Met -\u003e `accept dev`, write a durable summary to the output dir, reply to\\n   m1 with `campaign-met`. Not met -\u003e send precise rework and repeat.\\n5. This is a small mission: if it stalls, wrap up honestly with the\\n   appropriate outcome and `--unmet` items rather than looping.\\n\"}","name":"write"},"id":"write_11","index":0,"type":"function"}]},"finish_reason":null,"index":0,"raw_output":null}],"created":1788418232,"id":"chatcmpl-39fe0c11cdbb41e4989999da6853d208","model":"accounts/fireworks/models/kimi-k3","object":"chat.completion.chunk","usage":null}

